{"4809480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Push It!", "steam_appid": 4809480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4828820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH IT!</strong> is a local split-control co-op game about two operators running an unstable emergency reactor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, the grid demands a new power load. Both players choose at the same time: stabilize the core or push for more output. Progress gets you closer to victory, but every megawatt costs heat, stability, and system failure risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play together on one device with keyboard + gamepad or two keyboard zones. Watch the reactor, argue over risk, time your boosts, and keep the station alive until the end of the shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op on one screen;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two operators with separate control panels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast simultaneous-choice rounds;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk streaks and output multipliers;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode with an AI partner;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel mode: compete for personal output without losing the shared reactor;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and single-gamepad support;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every megawatt has a price.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH IT!</strong> is a local split-control co-op game about two operators running an unstable emergency reactor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, the grid demands a new power load. Both players choose at the same time: stabilize the core or push for more output. Progress gets you closer to victory, but every megawatt costs heat, stability, and system failure risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play together on one d